## Sites
table = site,manager,orders shipped,on-time percent; Reno NV,Alicia Tran,11940,97.8; Columbus OH,Marcus Bell,14380,97.2; Dallas TX,Priyanka Rao,12115,96.5; **Savannah GA**,Joel Okafor,9775,93.6

**Savannah GA** is the site to look at first, at 93.6 percent on time. Dallas TX is worth watching at 96.5 percent.

## Needs attention
- Savannah's container crane was out of service from 2026-10-12 to 2026-10-15. That left a backlog of 1150 orders.
- The backlog should be cleared by 2026-10-19 with approved overtime.

## Next week
- Crane inspection sign-off on 2026-10-18.
- 220 seasonal associates start on 2026-11-02.
